38262>>>>>    Procedure SetActionButtons
38265>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38265>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38265>>>>>        Boolean bHasRecord
38265>>>>>        Handle hoDD
38265>>>>>
38265>>>>>        Get Server to hoDD
38266>>>>>        Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
38267>>>>>        Get HasRecord of hoDD to bHasRecord
38268>>>>>
38268>>>>>        // let's hide all buttons and then Show the ones we want
38268>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to False
38269>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to False
38270>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to False
38271>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to False
38272>>>>>
38272>>>>>        If (NavigateData.bReadOnly) Begin
38274>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to True
38275>>>>>        End
38275>>>>>>
38275>>>>>        Else Begin
38276>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
38277>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
38278>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
38279>>>>>        End
38279>>>>>>
38279>>>>>    End_Procedure
