39329>>>    // --- SE MUEVE AQUÍ ABAJO: Evita el error de referencia hacia adelante del compilador ---
39329>>>    Procedure OnNavigateForward tWebNavigateData NavigateData Integer hoInvokingView Integer hoInvokingObject
39332>>>        Case Begin
39332>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromMain)
39334>>>                Case Break
39335>>>
39335>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromParent)
39338>>>                Case Break
39339>>>
39339>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromChild)
39342>>>                Case Break
39343>>>
39343>>>            Case Else 
39343>>>        Case End
39343>>>
39343>>>        Send SetActionButtons
